# Gitignored files a new worktree should start with, read by
# `wt step copy-ignored` (the pre-start hook in .config/wt.toml) and by
# Claude Code desktop's worktrees. Copies are APFS reflinks: instant, and no
# extra disk until one side writes.
#
# Deliberately just the DuckDB framework (#148). Build/ and PacerCore/.build
# hold absolute paths to the checkout they were built in, so a copy is no
# faster than a clean build and can confuse Xcode. keys/ holds release
# credentials and must never be fanned out across worktrees.
Vendor/DuckDB.xcframework/
